  "question": "How should the project adjudicate the conflict between NLC's 2019 official reprint dating Zheng Zhenduo's 《关于〈永乐大典〉》 to People's Daily 1951-08-13 and NLC's 2025 official review bibliography dating it to People's Daily 1951-08-31?",
